    "# Student Average Calculator Activity\n",
    "\n",
    "## 1. Identify the Components\n",
    "### 1.1 Inputs\n",
    "- Student name\n",
    "- Three test scores\n",
    "- Continue choice (Y/N)\n",
    "\n",
    "### 1.2 Process\n",
    "- Read the inputs\n",
    "- Calculate the average of the three scores\n",
    "- Check whether the average is greater than or equal to 50\n",
    "- Print a pass or fail message\n",
    "- Ask the user whether to continue\n",
    "\n",
    "### 1.3 Output\n",
    "- The student average\n",
    "- A pass/fail result\n",
    "- A final program end message\n",
    "\n",
    "## 2. Design the Algorithm\n",
    "### 2.1 Pseudocode\n",
    "```text\n",
    "START\n",
    "REPEAT\n",
    "    INPUT student name\n",
    "    INPUT three scores\n",
    "    average = (score1 + score2 + score3) / 3\n",
    "    IF average >= 50 THEN\n",
    "        PRINT \"Pass\"\n",
    "    ELSE\n",
    "        PRINT \"Fail\"\n",
    "    ENDIF\n",
    "    INPUT continue choice (Y/N)\n",
    "UNTIL choice is N\n",
    "PRINT \"Program Ended\"\n",
    "END\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "### 2.2 Algorithm Structure\n",
    "- Sequence: input, calculate, display, and repeat\n",
    "- Selection: check if average is greater than or equal to 50\n",
    "- Iteration: repeat the process while the user chooses Y\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Student Average Calculator\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"Student Average Calculator\")\n",
    "\n",
    "while True:\n",
    "    name = input(\"Enter student name: \").strip()\n",
    "\n",
    "    scores = []\n",
    "    for i in range(3):\n",
    "        while True:\n",
    "            try:\n",
    "                score = float(input(f\"Enter score {i + 1}: \\"))\n",
    "                if 0 <= score <= 100:\n",
    "                    scores.append(score)\n",
    "                    break\n",
    "                print(\"Please enter a value between 0 and 100.\")\n",
    "            except ValueError:\n",
    "                print(\"Invalid input. Please enter a number.\")\n",
    "\n",
    "    average = sum(scores) / len(scores)\n",
    "    print(f\"{name}'s average is {average:.2f}\")\n",
    "\n",
    "    if average >= 50:\n",
    "        print(\"Result: Pass\")\n",
    "    else:\n",
    "        print(\"Result: Fail\")\n",
    "\n",
    "    choice = input(\"Continue? Select Y/N: \").strip().upper()\n",
    "    if choice != \"Y\":\n",
    "        break\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"Program Ended\")"
   ]
  }
